Check .pillars grid: each .card has padding and width auto; grid gap may cause width? On mobile grid-template-columns:1fr, so each card takes full width of container minus gap? No gap.

Potential overflow from .cta-band? .cta-band has padding var(--space-6) = 32px each side, plus container maybe.

